{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57231","headline":"谶 二十 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高峰（《天圣广灯录》作「岭」）逢人又脱衣，小蛇虽毒不能爲。\n可中井底看（《天圣广灯录》作「着」）天近，小是沙弥善大机。\n大浪虽高不足知，百年凡木长乾枝。\n一鸟南飞却归北，二人东往却（《天圣广灯录》作「复」）还西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}